        <mxCell id="6_cD593aKtvb4QbaYVan-2" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 95%;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 95%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Định nghĩa Tích chập Giãn (Dilated Convolution)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Đây là phép toán tổng quát với hệ số giãn &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;l&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;42&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;l&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Công thức:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;math-block&quot; data-math=&quot;(F *_l k)(p) = \sum_{s+lt=p} F(s)k(t)&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;$$(F *_l k)(p) = \sum_{s+lt=p} F(s)k(t)$$&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Giải thích:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;l&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;l&lt;/span&gt;: Hệ số giãn (Dilation factor). Khi &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;l=1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;l=1&lt;/span&gt;, nó trở về tích chập thông thường.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;lt&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;lt&lt;/span&gt;: Khoảng cách giữa các trọng số trong bộ lọc được nhân lên &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;l&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;61&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;l&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;lần.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 95%; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Cơ chế:&lt;/b&gt; Thay vì lấy các điểm ảnh kề nhau, bộ lọc sẽ &quot;nhảy bước&quot; để lấy mẫu các điểm ảnh cách nhau một khoảng &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;l&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;109&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;l&lt;/span&gt;. Điều này giúp bộ lọc bao phủ vùng rộng hơn mà không làm tăng số lượng tham số &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;k&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;190&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Công thức vùng cảm nhận&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;$$\text{RF}_{i+1} = (2^{i+2} - 1) \times (2^{i+2} - 1)$$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Vùng cảm nhận của phần tử tại F&lt;sub style=&quot;&quot;&gt;i+1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="520" width="755" x="10" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
